D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.250</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τινός</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.212</span> </span>: abs., <b class=\"lex-tr\">vote an acquittal,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">34d</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">39e</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. τινὸς ὡς οὐκ ἀδικεῖ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">951b1</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">vote the franchise away from</b> one, <b class=\"lex-tr\">disfranchise,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">57.11</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοῦ παιδός</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">59.59</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.114</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. μὴ εἶναι ἐλεύθερον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ath.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">42.1</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">τὸν ἀποψηφισθέντα Ἀντιφῶντα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.132</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δικαίως ἔστ' ἀπεψηφισμένος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aristopho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.1</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. τοῦ πολιτεύματος</span> 